        or a nominal sum where required by mandatory local law. Nothing in
        these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law, and
        nothing affects consumer rights you hold under mandatory local law.
      </p>

      <h2>Termination</h2>
      <p>
        You can stop using the website and the plugin at any time, and can
        uninstall the plugin like any other WordPress plugin. We may suspend
        or terminate any paid license services (updates, support,
        activations) for material breach of these terms, such as key resale
        or license circumvention. Sections that by their nature should
        survive termination, including licensing, disclaimers, and
        limitation of liability, survive.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of Pakistan, without regard to
        conflict-of-law rules, and disputes are subject to the exclusive
        jurisdiction of the courts of Pakistan. If you use the plugin or
        this website as a consumer, you retain any protections granted by
